{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mlsf2hwr","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":224,"width":180,"height":20},"text":"PROBLEM","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6961","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9o3edcf2","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":240,"top":221,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"Authors had to turn a message into a polished newsletter without starting every edition from a blank canvas or losing control of the layout.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/onux47eh","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":285,"width":650,"height":0},"geometry":"line","lineColor":"#D9E1D8","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zi1w72x0","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":312,"width":180,"height":20},"text":"DISCOVERY","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6961","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ehsfyxwf","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":240,"top":309,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"I looked at the work as an end-to-end authoring journey: choose a starting point, structure the story, make edits safely, check the hierarchy, and confirm the final output. The recurring issue was not a lack of features; it was the number of small decisions an author had to make alone.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/0zm1kb6d","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":373,"width":650,"height":0},"geometry":"line","lineColor":"#D9E1D8","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/10vitgny","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":400,"width":180,"height":20},"text":"ACTION","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6961","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ed4ji1o7","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":240,"top":397,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"I led the work from discovery through design and prototype. I defined the content model, separated layout primitives from content blocks, designed templates and the component palette, then built the canvas, contextual inspector, preview, and editing states.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zyd0r65s","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":461,"width":650,"height":0},"geometry":"line","lineColor":"#D9E1D8","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cbm1gr61","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":488,"width":180,"height":20},"text":"RESULT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6961","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dcvipwnm","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":240,"top":485,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"The authoring workflow became easier to enter, easier to refine, and easier to reuse. Templates provided structure while blocks stayed editable, giving the author a clear starting point without removing creative control.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/q9kje1ob","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":549,"width":650,"height":0},"geometry":"line","lineColor":"#D9E1D8","lineWidth":1}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rat0nm5g","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":576,"width":180,"height":20},"text":"COLLABORATION","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6961","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w761sv6l","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":240,"top":573,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"I worked across content, product, and engineering decisions: what should be reusable, which fields were required, how long content should behave, and how the authored newsletter should render in desktop and mobile preview.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/x8f210n6","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":56,"top":637,"width":650,"height":0},"geometry":"line","lineColor":"#D9E1D8","lineWidth":1}
