{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x036hsj2","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":240,"top":309,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"I reviewed the recurring interface decisions that create drift: what belongs in navigation, how records are summarized, how states are named, how content expands on smaller screens, and where accessibility or localization changes the layout.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
