{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/36tkn29s","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":240,"top":397,"width":460,"height":54},"text":"I defined reusable patterns for navigation, forms, records, dialogs, media, status, and responsive layouts. I worked through longer labels, empty and error states, accessibility labels, localization, and the difference between required and flexible content.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#17211B","alignment":"left"}}
